blocks.en:
Table 15: Training-recipe ablations on OSWorld with Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct.
“ − - CoT” denotes the removal of all CoT text while retaining action text only;
“ − - History CoT” denotes the removal of historical CoT while retaining the current-step CoT and action text;
“ + + Failure Data” denotes augmenting the SFT samples with partial rejection-sampled failure samples.

blocks.zh:
表15:使用Qune3-VL-32B-指令在OSWorld上进行的培训-复制。
“−-CoT”表示删除所有CoT文本,而仅保留行动文本;
“--历史联系”表示删除历史联系,同时保留目前步骤的联系和行动案文;
“++故障数据”是指用部分拒绝抽样的故障样本来增加SFT样本。
